{"speciesId":431,"names":{"fr":"Chaglam","es":"Glameow","en":"Glameow","ja":"ニャルマー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It claws if displeased and purrs when affectionate. Its fickleness is very popular among some."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"With its sharp glare, it puts foes in a mild hypnotic state. It is a very fickle Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it’s happy, GLAMEOW demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When it’s happy, GLAMEOW demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a tendance à planter ses griffes dans le nez de son Dresseur s’il n’a pas été nourri à temps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a tendance à planter ses griffes dans le nez de son Dresseur s’il n’a pas été nourri à temps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il griffe quand il est en colère et ronronne quand il est heureux. Certains aiment ce côté lunatique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Araña cuando está enfadado y ronronea cuando está cariñoso. Su imprevisibilidad es famosa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It claws if dis